# Alias usage (admin-dashboard)

- Use the `@/` alias for all imports from `src/` (configured in `vite.config.js` and `jsconfig.json`).
- Prefer `@/components/...`, `@/auth/...`, `@/theme/...`, `@/api/...`, `@/layouts/...`, `@/pages/...` over long relative paths (`../../../`).
- Do not introduce additional aliases without updating both Vite and `jsconfig.json`.
